          <p source="#source-25972-26047"><seg source="#source-25972-25975">（</seg><hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-25975-26006" corresp="#source-25977-26006"><seg source="#source-25975-25977">10</seg></hi>）『後漢書』卷八十三徐穉傳</p>
          <p source="#source-26047-26161"><seg source="#source-26047-26050">（</seg><hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-26050-26081" corresp="#source-26052-26081"><seg source="#source-26050-26052">11</seg></hi>）『晉書』卷七十一陳<g ref="#gaiji-U-9835-147-11" source="#source-26111-26156">頵</g><seg source="#source-26156-26161">傳</seg></p>
          <p source="#source-26161-26239"><seg source="#source-26161-26164">（</seg><hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-26164-26195" corresp="#source-26166-26195"><seg source="#source-26164-26166">12</seg></hi>）『資治通鑑』梁紀十三陳紀五</p>
          <p source="#source-26239-26311"><seg source="#source-26239-26242">（</seg><hi rend="text-combine-upright" snh:layout-kind="tcy" source="#source-26242-26273" corresp="#source-26244-26273"><seg source="#source-26242-26244">13</seg></hi>）『晉書』卷百五石勒傳下</p>
